  "text": "About Us\nLoans\nContact Us\nDownload InCred App\nPay EMI\nBorrow. With Confidence.\n\nInCred is a new-age financial services platform that leverages technology and data science across its suite of offerings.\n\nExplore Now\nStudent Loans\n\nStudy abroad with Confidence\n\nApply Now\nLoan Against Property\n\nMake your next big move with Confidence\n\nApply Now\nPersonal Loans\n\nFulfill your dreams with Confidence\n\nApply Now\nSpecialised MSME Loans\n\nFor E-commerce Sellers, Restaurants and Cloud Kitchens, Fleet Operators, SaaS and AI companies,D2C Brands & Startups\n\nApply Now\nLoan Products\nPersonal Loans\n\nNeed funds fast to manage life's urgent expenses\n\nApply now\nStudent Loans\n\nPlan higher studies overseas to build a global future\n\nApply now\nLoans to Financial Institutions\n\nPowering NBFCs with specialized financing for diverse onward lending categories\n\nApply now\nSecured Business Loans\nLoan Against Property\n\nUnlock your property's value for bigger financial goals\n\nApply now\nSchool Financing\n\nScale your school with specialized loans for upgrades\n\nApply now\nSpecialised MSME Loans\nEmbedded Financing\n\nEmpower your online business growth with InCred\n\nApply now\nAsset Backed Financing\n\nAcquire assets and unlock capital with lease-based financing\n\nApply now\nCheck Your Credit Score For Free\nEncrypted & Secure\nImpact-Free Check\nUnlock Digital Credit Eligibility\nGet Started\nto check your score\nPowered by\nYour Trust. Our Confidence.\nBorrowers\n385,551\n+\nCRISIL & ICRA Rating\nAA-/Stable\nEmployees\n2,602\n+\nBranches\n135\n+\nIn The News\nSeptember 24, 2025\nQuick commerce and instant gratification are changing how people shop, forcing MSMEs to focus on faster delivery, wider distribution, and better marketplace visibility.\nRead more\nAugust 28, 2025\nInCred Finance joins Pro Kabaddi League as an associate partner for ‘Jaipur Pink Panthers’ and ‘Gujarat Giants’\nRead more\nMay 26, 2025\nRadhika Zingade of InCred Group on building financial confidence with knowledge and trust\nRead more\nView More\nCustomer Success Stories\nI have always been passionate about studying abroad, but since my income was a question of concern, I didn't get the expected support from any financial institutions until I came across InCred's Education Loan and reached out to them. The assistance I got from InCred's team made me feel, valued, and here I am, excelling in my career in Computer Science at Rivier University in the USA.\nSubba Rao\nStudent Loan Customer\nIn 2021, I was searching for funding to expand my business. During my quest, I learned about InCred Finance and contacted them to discuss my loan needs. The staff was very supportive and disbursed the amount in no time. I am thoroughly satisfied with the customer service as I received assistance throughout my loan tenure and received prompt responses to all of my queries.\nKalpesh Laxman Bhoir\nBusiness Loan Customer\nThe customer service provided by the team was a big value add. A special mention for the fast processing of the loan which was very important for me.\nAmey Sakpal - VFX Manager\nPersonal Loan Customer\nI have always been passionate about studying abroad, but since my income was a question of concern, I didn't get the expected support from any financial institutions until I came across InCred's Education Loan and reached out to them. The assistance I got from InCred's team made me feel, valued, and here I am, excelling in my career in Computer Science at Rivier University in the USA.\nSubba Rao\nStudent Loan Customer\nIn 2021, I was searching for funding to expand my business. During my quest, I learned about InCred Finance and contacted them to discuss my loan needs. The staff was very supportive and disbursed the amount in no time. I am thoroughly satisfied with the customer service as I received assistance throughout my loan tenure and received prompt responses to all of my queries.\nKalpesh Laxman Bhoir\nBusiness Loan Customer\nProducts\nPersonal Loans\nStudent Loans\nSecured Business Loans\nSpecialised MSME Loans\nLoans to Financial Institutions\nCompany\nAbout Us\nInCred in News\nTestimonials\nAdvisory Notes\nRecovery Agents\nTerminated Outsourcing Vendors\nPrivacy Policy\nInvestor Relation\nInCred Group\nInCred Financial Services Limited\n(Formerly \"KKR India Financial Services Limited\")\nBoard of Directors\nCorporate Details\nResignation of Directors\nAuction Notices\nPolicies\nCMS Portal of RBI\nSachet Portal of RBI\nRegulatory\nLocate Us\nOur Addresses and Locations\nSupport\nFAQ\nOmbudsman Scheme\nCareers\nFollow Us\n© Copyright 2026 InCred\nInCred Financial Services Limited (Formerly \"KKR India Financial Services Limited\") is a NBFC registered with the RBI",
